│   ├── model_selection.py    # Cross-validation & model selection
│   ├── train_predict.py      # Final training & predictions
│   └── utils/                # Helper functions (ia01.* modules)
│
├── results/
│   └── y_test.csv            # Final submission file
│
├── Rapport_Projet_IA.pdf     # Full project report (French)
└── README.md                 # This file
```

---

## 🧪 Technologies Used
- **Language:** Python 3
- **Libraries:** Custom AI01 modules only (`ia01.utils`, `ia01.arbre`)
- **Models:** Decision Tree, k-Nearest Neighbors (k-NN)
- **Metrics:** Macro F1-Score, Error Rate

---

## 🚀 How to Run
1. Clone the repository:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/health_problem_prediction.git
   cd health_problem_prediction
   ```

2. Run the full training & prediction pipeline:
   ```bash
   python src/train_predict.py
   ```

3. Final predictions will be saved to:
   ```
   results/y_test.csv
   ```

